  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/A1/). VERDICT: PARTLY-STALE: both symptoms hold, limb (2)'s attribution was wrong. Fixture: Svc#run -> ruby:User:0-0:where/find/create {receiver_type_hint User, external_owner_ancestors ['Base']}; io_primitives/ has no ruby file; io-boundaries reports unsupported_languages ['ruby'], 0 io edges. But ruby.py keeps the full text (the ApplicationRecord node has base_classes ['ActiveRecord::Base']); the short 'Base' is minted by the CORE inheritance linker, linkers/inheritance.py::_external_base_edge (:327) via _canonical_base_name (last segment), whenever no in-tree namesake exists; java shows the same (WI-tafum's 'JpaRepository'). Not WI-kazut's family. Title re-scoped. ROOT-CAUSE GROUPS: framework-inherited owner stamped but unrowed (with WI-tafum, WI-gokun); inheritance-linker external base by last segment (with WI-tafum, INV-dosoz's second extends edge, WI-ligin). Status unchanged."  # 9d5b
